  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "MISSION 1 - \u201CB-DAY\u201D\n\nIT WAS A PEACEFUL DAY, JUST LIKE ANY
    OTHER, WHEN THE WORLD CAME TO AN END.\n\nBUGS THE SIZE OF BUILDINGS BURST FROM
    THE GROUND, DESTROYING AND DEVOURING ALL IN THEIR PATH. conventional WEAPONS
    DID LITTLE TO STOP THEIR ONSLAUGHT.\n\nSO HUMANITY BANDED TOGETHER, POOLING THEIR
    RESOURCES TO CREATE SOMETHING THAT COULD FIGHT THESE GIANT CREATURES. \n\nPROJECT
    \u201CBUGSTOMPER\u201D, A MECH THAT COULD MATCH THE SIZE AND STRENGTH OF THE
    BUGS, AND YOU ARE ITS PILOT!\n\nTODAY IS THE DAY HUMANITY STRIKES BACK, AND WILL
    RETAKE THEIR LOST HOMES!\n\nGOOD LUCK PILOT!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a42a157b2e6473f4697c7fd42d38f9b4, type: 2}
